      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town lies just three miles south of Buena Vista, making it a quick stop for travelers heading into the San Isabel National Forest.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
