      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Arkansas River near Johnson Village is a prime spot for catching healthy‑sized brown trout, with many rafters fishing while floating down the river.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20,
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.uncovercolorado.com/towns/johnson-village/",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Wilderness Aware Rafting, a local outfitting company, offers half‑day and full‑day trips into Browns Canyon, a glacially carved gorge known for its towering rock walls.",
